* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* WARNING - STALE REFERENCE NETLIST
* Device sizes in this file do not match the shipped layout: e.g. BUFX2 has
* 4 transistors here but 6 in the GDS, INVX1 pfet is w=4u l=0.4u here but
* w=6u l=1.0u in the layout.  Do not use for LVS sign-off or simulation.
* Regenerate from the GDS (magic extract) before enabling W/L comparison.
* See OR1PDK/STATUS-2026-10-31-contract-conflicts.md.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

.subckt BUFX2 vdd A Y gnd
M0 vdd A a_2_6# vdd pfet w=4u l=0.4u
+ ad=0p pd=0u as=0p ps=0u 
M1 Y a_2_6# vdd vdd pfet w=8u l=0.4u
+ ad=0p pd=0u as=0p ps=0u 
M2 gnd A a_2_6# gnd nfet w=2u l=0.4u
+ ad=0p pd=0u as=0p ps=0u 
M3 Y a_2_6# gnd gnd nfet w=4u l=0.4u
+ ad=0p pd=0u as=0p ps=0u 
.ends BUFX2

